# Way of the Necromancer leaving in the same event as a creature Bot1 controls still sees it die (CR 603.10a, 603.6c:
# a leaves-the-battlefield trigger looks back in time). Turn 1 Bot1 casts Karn, Scion of Urza (5 loyalty) off four Moxen
# and an Ornithopter; turn 3 Way of the Necromancer empowers Jace 2. Turn 4 Bot2's Culling Ritual destroys every nonland
# permanent of mana value 2 or less at once: the Moxen, the Ornithopter, the Way and the Jace token. The Way's trigger
# for the Ornithopter puts one loyalty counter on Karn (mana value 4, the only planeswalker left): 5 to 6.

